  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 네가,\nMZ단의 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0006>니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020B124AC00002C000A004D005AB2E8C758002000100002010000000010000219000006B2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "닮았다고 많이 들어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2EEC558B2E4ACE00020B9CEC7740020B4E4C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 그랬구나.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020ADF8B7ACAD6CB098002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유명인의 삶은 피곤할 테니\n이름을 숨기고 싶어 하는 건 내가 이해하마.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720BA85C778C7580020C0B6C7400020D53CACE4D5600020D14CB2C8000AC774B984C7440020C228AE30ACE00020C2F6C5B40020D558B2940020AC740020B0B4AC000020C774D574D558B9C8002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실은 유명 트레이너인 네게\n들어 주었으면 하는 이야기가 있어서 말이다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C7400020C720BA850020D2B8B808C774B108C7780020B124AC8C000AB4E4C5B40020C8FCC5C8C73CBA740020D558B2940020C774C57CAE30AC000020C788C5B4C11C0020B9D0C774B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 인기 없는 소설가인데,\n지금 어떤 스토리를 구상 중이란다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020C778AE300020C5C6B2940020C18CC124AC00C778B370002C000AC9C0AE080020C5B4B5A40020C2A4D1A0B9ACB97C0020AD6CC0C10020C911C774B780B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데, 인물 설정에 애를 먹는 중이라\n유명인인 너를 참고하고 싶은데, 괜찮을까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370002C0020C778BB3C0020C124C815C5D00020C560B97C0020BA39B2940020C911C774B77C000AC720BA85C778C7780020B108B97C0020CC38ACE0D558ACE00020C2F6C740B370002C0020AD1CCC2EC744AE4C003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구체적으로는 지금부터 말하는 포켓몬들을\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 보여 줬으면 한단다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CCCB4C801C73CB85CB2940020C9C0AE08BD80D1300020B9D0D558B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C744000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020BCF4C5EC0020C92CC73CBA740020D55CB2E8B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "첫 번째, 땅타입 포켓몬.\n두 번째, 화염방사를 배운 포켓몬.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n세 번째, 메가스톤을 지니고 있는 포켓몬.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCAB0020BC88C9F8002C0020B545D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC002E000AB4500020BC88C9F8002C0020D654C5FCBC29C0ACB97C0020BC30C6B40020D3ECCF13BAAC002E00100001BE00000AC1380020BC88C9F8002C0020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020C9C0B2C8ACE00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 부탁하마.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n몇 번이든 설명해 줄 테니\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 데려와 주렴.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020BD80D0C1D558B9C8002E00100001BE01000ABA870020BC88C774B4E00020C124BA85D5740020C9040020D14CB2C8000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020B370B824C6400020C8FCB834002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 원하는\n세 마리의 포켓몬을 데려왔니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
