      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B54C002C0020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020AC00C9C4002000100002010200040010000219000003000AB458C7580020C55EC5D00020B098D0C0B098002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자신과의 진검승부에서 이기면\n메가스톤을 주겠노라며 도발해 온다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C2E0ACFCC7580020C9C4AC80C2B9BD80C5D0C11C0020C774AE30BA74000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020C8FCACA0B178B77CBA700020B3C4BC1CD5740020C628B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제안에 응한 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 앞세워 싸우려는 찰나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CC548C5D00020C751D55C002000100002010200020010000219000003000A001000020100000000100002190000020020C55EC138C6CC0020C2F8C6B0B824B2940020CC30B098002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑자기 나타난 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003>\n메가스톤을 가로채기 위해<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n모두를 향해 화염방사를 뿜어 댔다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
