      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C790AE300020B098D0C0B09C002000100002010200030010000219000003000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020AC00B85CCC44AE300020C704D57400100001BE00000ABAA8B450B97C0020D5A5D5740020D654C5FCBC29C0ACB97C0020BFDCC5B40020B314B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 감싼 채\n화염방사를 견뎌 낸 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
